"Weblate settings as :file:`settings.py` (there is also expanded version "
"in :file:`settings-expanded.py`)."
msgstr ""
"Weblate-inställningar som :file:`settings.py` (det finns också en utökad "
"version i :file:`settings-expanded.py`)."

msgid "PostgreSQL database backup as :file:`database.sql`."
msgstr "PostgreSQL-databasbackup som :file:`database.sql`."

msgid "Environment dump as :file:`environment.yml`."
msgstr "Miljö dump som :file:`environment.yml`."

msgid ""
"The database backups are saved as plain text by default, but they can also "
"be compressed or entirely skipped using :setting:`DATABASE_BACKUP`."
msgstr ""
"Databasbackuperna sparas som vanlig text som standard, men de kan också "
"komprimeras eller helt hoppas över med hjälp av :setting:`DATABASE_BACKUP`."

msgid ""
"To restore the database backup, load it using database tools, for example:"
msgstr ""
"För att återställa databasbackupen, ladda den med hjälp av databasverktyg, "
